    2071/    2CAA :                     Tit_ActivateCheat:
    2072/    2CAA :                     		; (On JAPANESE consoles only) Activated cheat depends on the amount of times C was pressed:
    2073/    2CAA :                     		; 0-1 level select -- 2-3 slow motion -- 4-5 debug mode -- 6-7: hidden Japanese credits & sound test 9E/9F
    2074/    2CAA :                     		; For any other regions, pressing C twice or more will ALWAYS result in slow motion and debug mode,
    2075/    2CAA :                     		; and the hidden Japanese credits cheat is unavailable under any circumstances on such consoles.
