    3710/    4C02 :                     ; Subroutine controlling Sonic on the ending sequence.
    3711/    4C02 :                     ; 
    3712/    4C02 :                     ; Many aspects of the game use the concept of a state machine.
    3713/    4C02 :                     ; If you are interested and want to learn more, these are Mealy and Moore machines
    3714/    4C02 :                     ; which have plenty of resources to teach you! This subroutine is a Moore machine.
    3715/    4C02 :                     ; Once you understand these concepts, Sonic 1's game logic will make a lot more sense to you!
    3716/    4C02 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    3717/    4C02 :                     
