    3770/    5058 :                     ; ===========================================================================
    3771/    5058 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    3772/    5058 :                     ; Credits ending sequence. This game mode works in tandem with the regular
    3773/    5058 :                     ; demo game mode, with both redirecting to here after their respective timer
    3774/    5058 :                     ; has expired. The variable v_creditsnum for the current page is deliberately
    3775/    5058 :                     ; located near the end of RAM so it doesn't get cleared during mode change.
    3776/    5058 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    3777/    5058 :                     
    3778/    5058 :                     ; CreditsScreen:
    3779/    5058 :                     GM_Credits:
    3780/    5058 :                     		; fading out from previous game mode (music gets already started before this)
    3781/    5058 : 6100 C936           		bsr.w	ClearPLC			; stop any potential in-progress PLC
    3782/    505C : 6100 CB64           		bsr.w	PaletteFadeOut			; fade-out previous game mode
    3783/    5060 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
