    4002/    5618 :                     
    4003/    5618 :                     
    4004/    5618 :                     ; Where possible, includes to _maps and _anim were appended to the _incObj
    4005/    5618 :                     ; file includes themselves. However, in some cases this wasn't possible,
    4006/    5618 :                     ; as the developers weren't very consistent with the placement, especially
    4007/    5618 :                     ; during the early stages of production. Those includes are still here.
    4008/    5618 :                     
