(1)  244/    A624 :                     ; --- X-positions for Chaos Emeralds in order of collection ---
(1)  245/    A624 :                     ; These values are pseudo-interlaced instead of going left-to-right,
(1)  246/    A624 :                     ; keeping consecutively collected emeralds overall centered (roughly).
(1)  247/    A624 : 0110                SSRC_PosData:	dc.w $110 ; 1st
(1)  248/    A626 : 0128                		dc.w $128 ; 2nd
(1)  249/    A628 : 00F8                		dc.w  $F8 ; 3rd
(1)  250/    A62A : 0140                		dc.w $140 ; 4th
(1)  251/    A62C : 00E0                		dc.w  $E0 ; 5th
(1)  252/    A62E : 0158                		dc.w $158 ; 6th
