(1)    2/    A6A2 :                     ; WARNING: These mappings cannot be altered with a normal sprite mappings
(1)    3/    A6A2 :                     ; editor, as some frames are cross-referenced across different objects!
(1)    4/    A6A2 :                     ;
(1)    5/    A6A2 :                     ; If you wish to edit them through such an editor, create separate files
(1)    6/    A6A2 :                     ; for the zone title cards, "SONIC HAS PASSED", and special stage results.
(1)    7/    A6A2 :                     ; The labels Map_Card, Map_Over, Map_Got, and Map_SSR must be migrated to
(1)    8/    A6A2 :                     ; new includes in the main source so that it won't cause any assembly errors.
(1)    9/    A6A2 :                     ; Then make duplicates of M_Card_Oval for Map_Got and Map_SSR, and also of
(1)   10/    A6A2 :                     ; M_Card_Act1/2/3 for Map_Got, so that they are no longer cross-referenced.
(1)   11/    A6A2 :                     ; Also, beware of the Game Over mappings sandwiched in between here!
