(1)    3/   10110 :                     ; Object 78 - Caterkiller enemy (MZ, SBZ)
(1)    4/   10110 :                     ; 
(1)    5/   10110 :                     ; This is easily the most complex badnik object in the entire game, and also
(1)    6/   10110 :                     ; a contender for the most complex object overall. It also came with a whole
(1)    7/   10110 :                     ; bunch of bugfixes introduced in REV01 to cover various edge cases.
(1)    8/   10110 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)    9/   10110 :                     
