(1)    6/   111F0 :                     ;	a0 = address of OST of Sonic
(1)    7/   111F0 :                     ; 
(1)    8/   111F0 :                     ; output:
(1)    9/   111F0 :                     ;	d0.l = (unused) -1 if Sonic touches an enemy or harmful object while invincible, or is hurt/killed
(1)   10/   111F0 :                     ;	a2 = address of OST of object hurting/killing Sonic
