(1)  521/   11A7C :                     SS_FindUnbeatenStage:
(1)  522/   11A7C :                     		; Skip special stages whose emerald has already been collected. The game cycles through stage IDs
(1)  523/   11A7C :                     		; using v_lastspecial: If the selected stage matches an entry in v_emldlist, execution branches
(1)  524/   11A7C :                     		; back to SS_Load and the next stage is selected. This repeats until an unbeaten stage is found.
(1)  525/   11A7C : 0C38 0006 FE57      		cmpi.b	#ss_emeralds_num,(v_emeralds).w		; do you already have all emeralds?
