(1)  348/   132A0 :                     ; Each entry in DebugList is 8 bytes in the following format:
(1)  349/   132A0 :                     ; 	0:   object ID
(1)  350/   132A0 :                     ;	0-3: mappings address (upper byte is ignored for 24-bit addressing)
(1)  351/   132A0 :                     ;	4:   subtype
(1)  352/   132A0 :                     ;	5:   frame ID
(1)  353/   132A0 :                     ;	6-7: VRAM settings
