    4688/   481E2 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    4689/   481E2 :                     
    4690/   481E2 :                     	; SoundDriver starts at $71990 in all revisions, which amounts
    4691/   481E2 :                     	; to $62A bytes of padding for rev00 and $63C for rev01/rev02.
    4692/   481E2 :                     	; It appears to be placed in such a way that the sound driver
    4693/   481E2 :                     	; ends right on the $80000 mark in the ROM in all revisions.
    4694/   481E2 :                     	; From a technical standpoint, this padding serves no purpose.
    4696/   481E2 :                     		; ProjectSonic1TwoEight requires $416 bytes of additional
    4697/   481E2 :                     		; padding to have the sound driver aligned to the same
    4698/   481E2 :                     		; position as the original game ($71990).
    4702/   481E2 : (MACRO)              			dcb.b	$63C+$416,$FF
    4702/   481E2 : FFFF FFFF FFFF              dc.b    [$63C+$416]$FF
