(1) 2052/   49D9E :                     ; PSG Note Values: c-1 to a-6
(1) 2053/   49D9E :                     ;
(1) 2054/   49D9E :                     ; Each row is an octave, starting with C and ending with B. Sonic 3's driver
(1) 2055/   49D9E :                     ; adds another octave at the start, as well as two more notes and the end to
(1) 2056/   49D9E :                     ; complete the last octave. Notably, a-6 is changed from 223721.56Hz to
(1) 2057/   49D9E :                     ; 6991.28Hz. These changes need to be applied here in order for ports of
(1) 2058/   49D9E :                     ; songs from Sonic 3 and later to sound correct.
(1) 2059/   49D9E :                     ;
(1) 2060/   49D9E :                     ; Here is what Sonic 3's version of this table looks like:
(1) 2061/   49D9E :                     ;		MakePSGFrequencies  109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    109.34,    110.20,    116.76,    123.73
(1) 2062/   49D9E :                     ;		MakePSGFrequencies  130.98,    138.78,    146.99,    155.79,    165.22,    174.78,    185.19,    196.24,    207.91,    220.63,    233.52,    247.47
(1) 2063/   49D9E :                     ;		MakePSGFrequencies  261.96,    277.56,    293.59,    311.58,    329.97,    349.56,    370.39,    392.49,    415.83,    440.39,    468.03,    494.95
