(1) 2065/   49D9E :                     ;		MakePSGFrequencies 1045.42,   1107.52,   1177.47,   1242.89,   1316.00,   1398.25,   1491.47,   1575.50,   1669.55,   1747.82,   1864.34,   1962.46
